1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,910
Glacial lakes above Hunza can burst and take bridges with them.

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,520
On many summer days, cloud hides them.

3
00:00:06,760 --> 00:00:10,200
We're SARcastic Scientists. We built SARtale.

4
00:00:10,440 --> 00:00:13,930
NASA and ISRO's NISAR radar sees straight through.

5
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:18,990
SARtale turns each pass into lake water, tracks every lake,

6
00:00:19,630 --> 00:00:22,420
and flags changes beyond its normal range.

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,710
Anyone can add a lake.

8
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:27,880
When clouds close in, the lakes stay in view.
